{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：中煤能源上半年煤化工利润贡献提升</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中煤能源交出的这份半年报，最值得看的不是煤炭主业，而是煤化工板块的利润弹性。MS在8月21日发布的业绩点评中给出一个清晰判断：上半年净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">81亿元</span>，但剔除一次性项目后的经常性利润增速达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，明显快于报表利润。两者之间的差距，主要来自煤化工业务的毛利率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把单季度拆开看，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43亿元</span>，同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>、环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，基本符合市场预期。毛利率从去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>扩至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28%</span>，这个<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>幅度在煤炭公司里不算小。更值得注意的是，公司账面净现金维持在180亿元，财务费用因借款利率下降同比减少14%，资产负债表依然扎实。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVTPmNEGKykBf0hzt6btaMw4S59CX37LtEasvVKPcQDGiaibdkdquKhfcormSQhaFN7XqKoC3DmjCfeMuFgDpCQtv9yxYTHgp76s/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 煤炭板块量减价升，自产煤产量受安全检查扰动</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看煤炭主业。上半年板块收入同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>，原因有两个：贸易煤销量调整，以及自产煤产量同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>。产量下降的主因是主产省份安全大检查导致部分矿井临时停产，其中焦煤产量受影响更明显，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>同比降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38%</span>、环比降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">49%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">价格端反而是支撑。上半年自产煤均价同比上升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>，高于秦皇岛5500大卡市场煤价<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>的涨幅。MS解释，这是因为公司煤质提升，热值更高。单位销售成本同比上升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>至286元/吨，主要来自人工成本增加和产量下降摊薄后的折旧上升。两相抵消，煤炭板块毛利率仍从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">44%</span>微扩至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45%</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看产量和均价的组合，产量降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>但均价涨<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>，说明这轮利润<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">韧性</span>主要靠价格而非销量。简单说，安全检查压的是供给，反而抬高了售价；后续更值得观察的是山西等地复产节奏，如果产量恢复快于预期，价格支撑会减弱。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXHic3owf9oFiahO305pwU0gnbLTPtQvRbElslHGPmmeNfNichPsJBa39Nkuib0xkoQMxINh7Dj6lf1wxCIDY9MepuiaPTT7VGfY8MY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 煤化工毛利率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>扩至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>，成为上半年最大增量</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告最突出的边际变化在煤化工。上半年该板块收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">104亿元</span>，销量和售价同步提升，后者受到中东局势对油煤比价关系的间接影响。毛利同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">62%</span>，毛利率从去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>大幅扩至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这个数字的意义在于，煤化工不再只是煤炭公司的副产品。当煤炭主业受制于产量天花板时，化工板块的毛利率弹性开始对整体利润形成实质贡献。MS在标题里直接点明“better profit contribution”，说明这并非一次性因素，而是产品结构变化带来的持续性<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUONmMuYADoLyx1PVibAXEvyiaeCwEJnicN7v7plOnYiaXDw4ok2apzOBZibmY0u7AFZicbwsxGgh9e5hHK3Jd3TXtibMz55f3negGzgg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>盈利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">韧性</span>有支撑，动力煤与焦煤价格逻辑不同</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>的判断偏乐观。动力煤方面，夏季用电高峰电厂日耗处于高位，叠加主产省安全检查持续压制供给，价格有支撑。焦煤的逻辑更直接，山西停产的矿井大多影响焦煤供应，供给调整对价格的支撑力度更强。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把两条线合在一起看，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>中煤能源的盈利大概率保持<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">韧性</span>。公司还宣布中期股息每股0.184元，派息率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>，延续了煤炭央企的股东回报风格。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 这里更值得关注的是焦煤产量数据，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>同比降近四成，幅度远大于动力煤。我的理解是，安全检查对焦煤供给的冲击更集中，这解释了为什么焦煤价格表现更强；后续观察<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">重点是</span>山西矿井复产进度，它直接决定<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>焦煤的量价平衡。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVN9KQq2p6LPryjf5aV4licibibJLtyYFnNQSvdvKOzQhsVnrWYffgKicYkF3QD60EfmXtStEd94eWG2lOpqEzhcnZl4WGZdLjWedA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 83-MS-China Coal Energy Co.- Ltd.-1898.HK-Better profit contribution from coal chemical in 1H26-260821</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
